			"The physical mapping is maintained for discovery and future legacy support.",
			"Corrected 2026-09-17: reduced from 6 to 4 buttons, dropping Back/Forward entirely. The G100s has no thumb buttons on either side -- confirmed by a primary hands-on review ('There are no thumb buttons on either side') and corroborated by the official Logitech spec page, which lists only 'Special Buttons: DPI toggle' with no Forward/Back field at all. Real layout: Left, Right, Middle, DPI toggle."
		]
